ew)","historical_business_count":2},{"category":"Restaurants","historical_business_count":8}],"history":[{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"American (New), Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"LOUm_-VWYI32COPsU_-wWg","review_id":"nJvgXVYQ5ptbNposxbACUA","date":"2015-12-04T06:22:04","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9359362721443176,"text_excerpt":"Located a block away from Bourbon Street right on Bienville, this is my new favorite happy hour martini bar. Right inside the Chateau LeMoyne Hotel, the bar also hosts a live jazz singing couple after 7pm when Happy Hour ends.They have a fun martini menu that has good descriptions of the different varieties, you'd think the martini was invented in New Orleans. The servers are awesome and fun to talk to. They make the martini's in front of you and they know their stuff. Happy Hour from 4-7 is especially awesome and if you're looking for the perfect way to get drunk while feeling classy, this is the joint! $3 martinis (several to choose from), $2 beers, $7 Sazeracs, and $2 food items. You c..."},{"business_id":"LOUm_-VWYI32COPsU_-wWg","review_id":"_2zG_jVDievA7Przq1RxWA","date":"2017-02-24T15:16:38","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9269040822982788,"text_excerpt":"What this place it about is martinis and live music. If you like both I think you will enjoy. If not there are plenty of other options. Cant speak to the food as we didnt have any. Service for us was excellent but we were also there with a local who is a regular. Martinis are amazing and they have over 100 options."},{"business_id":"LOUm_-VWYI32COPsU_-wWg","review_id":"dnaNgERwaDe2spHfIS5wGA","date":"2017-03-27T19:04:37","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.920178234577179,"text_excerpt":"We stopped in here almost everyday for the happy hour! You can't go wrong! $3 martinis $3 bite of the day (appetizers rotate daily) you can't beat it! Who doesn't love a lemon drop martini?? Also the bar tenders were very friendly! Great pit stop"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"LOUm_-VWYI32COPsU_-wWg","photo_id":"eC25dpC0ggKiF7I09Fdthw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/eC25dpC0ggKiF7I09Fdthw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8835075497627258},{"business_id":"LOUm_-VWYI32COPsU_-wWg","photo_id":"1f-5RKJGZaZKLSHjWb-7_w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/1f-5RKJGZaZKLSHjWb-7_w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8776674270629883},{"business_id":"LOUm_-VWYI32COPsU_-wWg","photo_id":"jg4ZFcsjlIiKN4rj9ZzXBQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/jg4ZFcsjlIiKN4rj9ZzXBQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8032957315444946},{"business_id":"LOUm_-VWYI32COPsU_-wWg","photo_id":"IAbVjisP5jELFOLgIBzYAw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/IAbVjisP5jELF